      "title": "Model link",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Report workflow issue\n\nIf you found any issues when running this workflow, [report them here](https://github.com/ChenDarYen/NitroFusion2/issues)\n\n## Model links\n\n- [Hugging Face:ChenDY/NitroFusion2](https://huggingface.co/ChenDY/NitroFusion2)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [Qwen3-4B-Q8_0.gguf](https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3-4B-GGUF/resolve/main/Qwen3-4B-Q8_0.gguf)\n- Other tiers: [unsloth/Qwen3-4B-GGUF](https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3-4B-GGUF/tree/main)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [nf2-Q4_K_M.gguf](https://huggingface.co/ChenDY/NitroFusion2/resolve/main/nf2-Q4_K_M.gguf) (5.07 GB)\n- Other tiers, from 2.0 GB to 7.2 GB: [ChenDY/NitroFusion2](https://huggingface.co/ChenDY/NitroFusion2/tree/main)\n\n\n**vae**\n\n- [ae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors) (319.8 MB)\n\nOne step (euler, simple). Keep cfg = 1.\n\nGGUF files need the [ComfyUI-GGUF](https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF) custom node (install it from ComfyUI-Manager).\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │      └── Qwen3-4B-Q8_0.gguf\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │      └── nf2-Q4_K_M.gguf\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│          └── ae.safetensors\n```\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
